	(text "POWER BUDGET AT 5 V  |  Engineering allocations, not measured maxima\n3V3 rail: MCU 60 + Flash 25 + sensors 5 + passive loads 30 = 120 mA\nLED controller allowance: 5 mA; RGB allowance: 125 mA\nOne board: 125 mA base / 250 mA with full RGB (0.625 / 1.25 W)\nSix boards, one RGB array active: 6 x 125 + 125 = 875 mA (4.375 W)\n20% source margin: 1.05 A target; cable and connector losses additional.\nPC USB current allowance is unverified; six-board budget is not approved.\nInactive arrays must enter shutdown; validate all allocations in firmware." (at 18 18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b5e0886d-bd5a-5cf8-97ce-066fa37cf8a3"))

	(text "POWER PATH AND LIMITS\nU9/U10 VOUT sharing follows TI LM66100 Fig.17.\nU10 ST is unused: GND per the pin-function table.\nSystem rail: +5V = SPI_OUT_5V, after input ORing.\nLM66100 provides reverse/backfeed protection, not current limiting.\nD13-D15 protect connector power rails (Interfaces).\nShort-circuit protection and TVS clamp coordination need review.\nUSB flashing does not establish permission to draw this budget." (at 166 18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5325533b-aa88-52dc-bd14-639b347ef04b"))

	(text "LDO AND CHAIN ESTIMATES\nP_U8 = (5 - 3.3) x 0.120 + 5 x 80uA = 0.2044 W.\nAP2112 600 mA rating is subject to thermal limits; verify junction rise.\nSix-stage far-end example, RGB active on board 6:\nI_stage = 0.875, 0.750, 0.625, 0.500, 0.375, 0.250 A.\nAt R_ON = 79 mOhm typical: sum(I x R) = 0.267 V.\nThis excludes cable/contact resistance and hot-device variation.\nSources, assumptions and validation steps are recorded in the HRM." (at 18 145 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a507a9e4-efdc-58a0-8e62-c0d4d68fca64"))

	(text "CONTROL RESISTORS  R23/R24 = 10k, 1%\nNegative injection estimate: 6 V / 9.9k = 0.606 mA < 1 mA limit.\nPositive pullup bound: 5.5 V / 9.9k = 0.556 mA.  See TI LM66100 Sec.6, Fig.17." (at 18 177 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57061463-21b1-5351-8da4-c89343fe1fd1"))

